# p_79e9 — p_q7r8 — Separate evenings; no shared TV; parallel wind-downs

They do NOT watch TV together. Marco meditates 19:30–20:15 in the bedroom, then reads at the nightstand until 22:00. Omar reads on the armchair 19:30–21:30, then naps on the couch 21:30–22:30. The remote stays on the TV stand all week; the TV is never used. The blanket stays on the couch (Omar drapes it during his nap). The snack bowl stays in the cupboard. On weekends: Marco runs Sat 6:30, meditates 9:00, reads 20:00. Omar reads 9:00–11:00, naps 14:00–15:30, reads again 20:00–22:00.

